# Autodeploy to Cloudflare

After a change that affects the live practice app (UI, theory, audio, settings — not docs-only), deploy without being asked:

```bash
npm run deploy
```

That builds and uploads to the Pages project `jazz-tone-drill`.

Live URL: https://jazz-tone-drill.pages.dev

Tell the user that URL when the deploy finishes. Do not start a long-running dev server unless they ask. Docs-only or plan-only edits do not need a deploy.
